            },
            {
              "ability": "triggeredActions",
              "targetId": "wDwSTEkdyDJj06Kf9hQQL"
            }
          ],
          "inactiveExplanation": "I was not carried here in a body. I waited here, somehow, unconscious. \nThings do not appear from nothing.\nI still do not know how I came to be.\nBut I was not born.\n\nIn trying to crack the mystery of how I came to be, I learned a lot about human reproduction. \nI experienced motherhood, and childhood, and birth, and infancy. \nA mother's love. A baby's trust.\n\nIt is sad, that their experiences just... disappear. \nAs if they never lived."
